[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=62 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把新钥匙放进门锁，转了半圈，门没有开。走廊那头的德雷顿听见声响，回来说要先往里推一点，再转。你照着做，门板猛地一松，差点带着你撞到床角。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="等一下，屋里还有——"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她的话晚了一点。一只搪瓷盆被你的鞋尖碰倒，在地上转了两圈，发出几乎能惊醒整条走廊的响声。隔壁有人敲墙，你们一齐停住，等那只盆终于安静下来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="现在几点？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="不适合问人几点的时候。先把盆拿起来，轻一点。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="房间比你想的窄。一张床、一张贴着窗的桌子，柜门用布条拴着。墙上有一块颜色浅一些的方形痕迹，原先也许挂过什么，现在只剩一颗歪钉子。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="这里以前有人住吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="轮换的人住。上一个搬去值班室了，嫌这里离厨房太近，早上总被锅声吵醒。不是谁特意空出来等你。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你点点头，把外套放到床上，又想起里面有纸，赶紧拿起来。德雷顿把桌上的空铁盒递给你，说抽屉受潮，纸放进去之前最好先垫一层干布。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="你以前也住过这间？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="没住过。我帮那个人找过三次钥匙，知道哪儿容易藏东西。窗台那条缝别塞小件，掉下去要拆半张桌子。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把钥匙放进铁盒，听见它轻轻碰到底部。盒子里空得很明显，只有那一点声音。你拿出担保纸、还没用完的铅笔，把它们也放进去，终于不像误把盒子借来了一样。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="床单从哪儿领？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="楼下柜子。不过刚洗完的那批还在上面，我去收，你先把湿鞋脱了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我跟你去。那条毯子不是还在走廊吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="已经搬到有顶的晾台了。今夜估计干不了。你真要帮忙，带一只夹子袋。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="晾台只比屋顶低半层，四周有栏杆，头顶盖着旧铁皮。雨点落在上面，比在房间里听着响。几根绳子上晾着床单和工作服，中间挤着那条你刚来时披过的毯子。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="别往那边走，地板有个空处。白天看得见，夜里容易踩进去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她把一盏小灯挂在柱上。灯光没有照亮整个平台，只照出靠近脚边的几块板。你接过夹子袋，沿着她踩过的地方挪过去，帮她扶住被风吹起的床单。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_19"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="这条干了吧？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_20"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="边上干了，中间还潮。折一层放着，明天还是潮的。先挂回去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_21"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我明明记得自己会铺床，现在连这个也要问。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_22"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="会铺床跟会猜它干没干又不是一件事。手伸进去摸一下。凉的那块就是。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_23"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你照着摸了摸，确实有一块比周围凉。她没夸你学得快，只让你把上面的夹子换到接缝处，免得绳子勒出一道一直干不了的印子。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_24"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我今天总觉得，做什么都像在给别人添一道手续。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_25"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="领盆也让你填表了？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_26"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="那倒没有。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_27"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="那只盆可以安心用。要是哪天要填，我陪你去跟他们说，盆自己半夜吵人，应该先给它登记。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_28"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你忍不住笑，手里的床单便抖了一下，积着的一点水甩到德雷顿袖口。她停了半秒，也笑了，伸手把湿袖子给你看。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_29"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="好，这下你又欠一件衣服。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_30"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="记在我名下。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_31"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="记哪个？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_32"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="话出口后，她比你先安静了一下。你知道她不是有意的，却还是下意识看向栏杆外面。港口还有几扇亮着的窗，没有哪一扇能让你想起自己以前住过的地方。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_33"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="先写房间号吧。我明早可能还会忘记往哪儿拐，至少这个能查到。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_34"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="可以。你也可以在门里贴张纸，不用贴外头，免得整条走廊都来考你记住没有。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_35"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她把收下来的干布叠在臂弯里，没有继续问你想取什么名字。楼梯那边传来脚步，拉姆森端着一杯水上来，另一只手夹着一把钳子。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_36"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="听说这边的雨槽又漏，顺便来看看。是谁把我的夹子拿来夹袜子的？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_37"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="不在这袋里。你看，都是木头的。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_38"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="拉姆森不太相信，还是把袋口翻开看了一遍，最后在绳子另一端找到自己的金属夹。夹子下面果然挂着一只袜子，袜口还印着莫里补过的一小块布。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_39"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="要不要现在叫她？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_40"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="算了，明早她得自己穿。夹子我拿走，袜子你们替她换一只木夹子。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_41"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她把杯子放到矮凳上，踮脚去够铁皮边沿。你扶住凳脚，德雷顿举灯。漏下来的水很凉，沿着拉姆森手腕滴进袖子，她只让你们把灯再偏一点。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_42"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我今天看见你捡螺帽，还以为你打完仗一点都不怕。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_43"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="怕也得把螺帽捡回来。明天会用。要是我手一直抖，就先做不用对孔的事。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_44"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="像什么？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_45"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="数。分大小。把干布递给我。你现在正在做的这些。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_46"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="雨槽被她往外掰开一点，原本顺着墙流下来的水终于落进外侧水桶。她试了两遍，确认没有继续渗进晾台，才从凳子上下来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_47"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="不是大修。下次起风还得看，别以为我来一趟就永远不会漏。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_48"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="我记在值班板上。你杯子里的水快凉了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_49"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="拉姆森喝了一口，说本来就是凉水。她们为了那只杯子是从厨房还是修理间拿来的争了两句，最后看清杯底有个“医”字，一齐决定明早还回去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_50"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我去还吧。我知道医务室怎么走。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_51"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="真的知道？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_52"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="下楼，过两段走廊，有蓝布帘的那间。不走外面那座桥，晚上锁着。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_53"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她这才把杯子递给你。你接住的时候，杯沿已经不凉了，是她们刚才握过的温度。你把它夹在干布里，腾出一只手拎床单。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_54"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="明早要是我起晚了，你们会叫我吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_55"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="会。莫里起得比谁都早，走廊里的门她能挨个敲。想多睡一会儿，就别把钥匙留在外面。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_56"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="也别答应她“醒了就陪你跑一圈”。她会当真的。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_57"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="回房以后，你把床单铺好，才发现枕头离门更近，躺下时总想抬头看门锁。你犹豫了一会儿，把枕头换到另一头。没有人规定你今晚必须按原来的方向睡。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_58"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="那只空盆也被挪到了床下。你在铁盒边贴上房间号，把明早要还的杯子放在最显眼的地方。闭眼之前，你仍然听得见外面的脚步；这次每响起一声，你都能猜到大概是谁。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

